As a follow-up, we can add the `twig.safe_class` resource tag to register them via the service container:

```php
->set(ComponentAttributes::class)
    ->resourceTag('twig.safe_class', ['strategy' => 'html'])
```

A compiler pass would collect the tagged classes and call `addSafeClass()` on `twig.runtime.escaper`.

Edit: I went ahead and added the resource tag in a second commit.

